Mistral is back with a trillion-parameter beast called "Le Chonk". 🐈🔥

@MistralAI just announced Mistral Large 4, its biggest and most capable model yet. It can process text and images, with 49 billion parameters active at a time out of more than a trillion in total. Mistral says it’s the strongest open-weight model developed outside China, taking aim at coding, AI agents and cybersecurity.

